WEBVTT

00:22.460 --> 00:26.680
Spice and Wolf

00:26.680 --> 00:27.800
Spice and Wolf

00:27.800 --> 00:33.140
Spice and Wolf

01:53.000 --> 01:57.010
<b>Episode 5
Wolf Incarnate and Obedient Lamb</b>

02:00.690 --> 02:02.600
A wolf incarnate?

02:02.600 --> 02:06.410
Then this letter is most definitely a threat.

02:06.410 --> 02:11.730
They will send her to the Church if we don't 
withdraw from this until everything is over.

02:11.730 --> 02:16.110
Yes, but there is no guarantee that they 
won't send her to the Church afterwards.

02:16.110 --> 02:18.120
On top of that, we have already invested

02:18.120 --> 02:21.700
in a lot of Trenni silver coins 
that have inflated in price.

02:22.030 --> 02:25.490
It would be a tremendous loss 
if we stepped back at this point.

02:25.490 --> 02:27.500
That means we have to be aggressive!

02:30.980 --> 02:34.670
However, let's say we take back your 
companion and put her under our care...

02:35.000 --> 02:38.200
If we are reported and the Church steps in,

02:38.200 --> 02:41.180
we can only become their obedient lambs.

02:41.540 --> 02:44.370
We cannot hide her anywhere in this town.

02:44.370 --> 02:46.460
What about escaping out of town?

02:46.460 --> 02:48.860
There are grasslands as far as the eye can see.

02:48.860 --> 02:51.310
It would require a great amount 
of luck to pull that off.

02:51.310 --> 02:57.780
She may still be reported in another town. 
Then, there is nothing we can do.

02:58.260 --> 03:02.780
Considering their prospective profits, 
we cannot solve this with money.

03:03.200 --> 03:07.570
The profits they can make could 
possibly destroy us, their rival company.

03:07.570 --> 03:12.460
So, we can only let them complete this deal 
and see if we are reported to the Church?

03:12.850 --> 03:15.400
If only we had some kind of trump card...

03:15.400 --> 03:17.340
There is one way.

03:17.700 --> 03:23.220
We can report Medio Trading 
for sheltering your companion.

03:23.830 --> 03:26.930
However, you'll have a problem 
with that, won't you?

03:26.930 --> 03:30.640
You may even testify against us.

03:31.970 --> 03:33.560
I definitely would.

03:47.980 --> 03:50.620
The greatest benefit of those 
Trenni silver coins is

03:50.620 --> 03:54.320
obtaining some kind of privilege 
from the King of Trenni, correct?

03:54.320 --> 03:55.090
Yes.

03:55.090 --> 03:59.740
According to our investigation, the royal 
family's finances are currently quite tight.

03:59.740 --> 04:01.010
I can imagine.

04:01.520 --> 04:04.540
After all, they're trying to melt down 
their current silver coins

04:04.540 --> 04:08.110
in order to produce more coins of 
lower purity to put into circulation.

04:08.610 --> 04:10.660
It will bring short-term benefits,

04:10.660 --> 04:14.310
but it will destroy the prestige of the royal 
family and be more harmful than beneficial.

04:14.740 --> 04:19.980
Their finances must truly be dire 
to do such a thing.

04:23.810 --> 04:27.010
In order to exchange the coins 
of higher purity,

04:27.010 --> 04:29.980
they will likely hand over 
mining rights, tariff-setting rights,

04:29.980 --> 04:34.580
and market management rights to us.

04:34.580 --> 04:39.660
That is the biggest profit we will gain 
from the purchase of their silver coins.

04:39.660 --> 04:40.750
Then...

04:41.120 --> 04:45.940
What about finishing our deal before 
the Medio Trading Company reports us

04:45.940 --> 04:49.810
and using that biggest profit 
as our trump card?

04:51.470 --> 04:53.600
You want us to allow them 
to buy the privilege from us?

04:53.600 --> 04:58.500
Yes, if we make the purchase more 
profitable than shutting you down,

04:58.500 --> 05:02.130
Medio Trading wouldn't report us.

05:02.130 --> 05:08.560
Their current trump card can 
send us to the burning stake.

05:08.560 --> 05:10.720
Will they accept?

05:10.720 --> 05:14.610
Of course, please consider 
the stance of the King of Trenni.

05:15.750 --> 05:19.740
The king wouldn't want the public to know 
they worked with a trading company

05:19.740 --> 05:21.460
that was sent to the stake.

05:21.460 --> 05:23.000
I see.

05:23.000 --> 05:29.720
If we are targeted by the Church, 
the Trenni Kingdom will also be targeted.

05:29.720 --> 05:32.260
If we finish our deal first,

05:32.260 --> 05:36.280
Medio Trading will not be able to 
report us for fear of the King of Trenni.

05:36.280 --> 05:39.030
If they do, they will take 
themselves down with us.

05:44.990 --> 05:48.650
If we appear in such a situation 
and offer the rights they want

05:48.650 --> 05:52.620
in exchange for a fair price 
and your companion...

05:53.300 --> 05:56.650
Yes, I'm sure they will agree.

05:56.650 --> 06:00.310
That will be the only way Medio Trading 
will be able to obtain the rights.

06:12.730 --> 06:17.770
Your reasoning is sound. However, 
there is still a large problem remaining.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.980
According to my analysis,

06:19.980 --> 06:23.230
Medio Trading has not collected 
all the silver coins they need.

06:23.230 --> 06:24.850
Why do you think so?

06:24.850 --> 06:27.440
This is a deal that takes advantage 
of a king's weakness.

06:27.940 --> 06:32.180
That's why they've been enticing 
merchants and collecting them secretly,

06:32.180 --> 06:35.080
so that they can obtain the silver coins 
as cheaply as possible.

06:35.390 --> 06:37.820
If they had collected enough silver,

06:37.820 --> 06:40.750
they would have sent Holo 
to the Church immediately.

06:40.750 --> 06:43.860
The fact that they're using her 
to stop our movements instead

06:43.860 --> 06:46.340
shows their lack of confidence.

06:46.340 --> 06:50.130
In other words, at this point they have 
not collected enough silver.

06:50.130 --> 06:51.340
I see.

06:52.080 --> 06:55.560
Then, what action do you plan 
to take Mr. Lawrence?

06:57.060 --> 07:01.230
I will steal Holo back and run around 
until your deal is complete.

07:02.440 --> 07:03.620
Reckless!

07:03.620 --> 07:06.940
Even if I can't throw them off, 
I can buy us some time.

07:06.940 --> 07:10.480
Please collect the rest of the silver 
and finish the deal by that time.

07:10.480 --> 07:11.740
That's impossible!

07:12.630 --> 07:14.780
Then, should we report Holo?

07:15.090 --> 07:18.120
I will definitely testify against you!

07:19.730 --> 07:23.380
With your help, I'm sure we can avoid 
being captured for a day or two.

07:23.650 --> 07:26.460
A wolf incarnate will be 
running around with me.

07:26.460 --> 07:30.380
She let herself be caught this time 
in order to let me escape.

07:30.380 --> 07:34.530
If she uses her true strength, 
no human would be her opponent.

07:37.570 --> 07:38.890
Let me ask you this.

07:39.290 --> 07:43.940
How long will it take you to gather 
enough silver to negotiate with the king?

07:46.530 --> 07:49.420
If we have a horse run to the Trenni castle,

07:49.420 --> 07:51.700
we should be able to finish the deal 
before the sun sets tomorrow.

07:51.700 --> 07:54.020
If we finish the deal successfully,

07:54.020 --> 07:57.340
the earliest we could return 
is dawn the day after tomorrow.

07:57.340 --> 07:58.410
Right now?

07:58.730 --> 08:02.180
Even though you still 
don't have all the silver?

08:02.180 --> 08:05.120
We can negotiate using estimated numbers.

08:05.120 --> 08:09.420
There will be no problem as long as we 
have the coins at the time of delivery.

08:09.420 --> 08:12.380
Do you think you'll be able to negotiate 
with the king on the spot?

08:13.860 --> 08:19.470
If the Milone Trading Company gets serious, 
any negotiation can be dealt with immediately.

08:21.060 --> 08:24.480
So, you must know 
where Holo is currently being held.

08:27.010 --> 08:30.230
We are the Milone Trading Company.

08:30.230 --> 08:32.680
Our employees getting attacked in the dark

08:32.680 --> 08:37.000
and our buildings getting set on fire 
is an everyday occurrence.

08:37.000 --> 08:40.300
Our emergency measures are perfect.

08:40.300 --> 08:43.250
However, there is a great wall 
blocking our way.

08:43.250 --> 08:44.720
The Church.

08:44.720 --> 08:45.880
That's right.

08:45.880 --> 08:49.400
They have more connections 
than we do across various countries.

08:49.400 --> 08:51.630
They're prepared to take action any time.

08:51.630 --> 08:56.130
That is why we must finish all of this 
before they decide to make a move.

08:56.740 --> 09:02.560
Normally, we wouldn't make a move until 
we knew who was backing Medio Trading.

09:02.560 --> 09:09.120
That way, we could make appropriate plans 
and perhaps snatch their funding as well.

09:09.120 --> 09:10.860
That is truly unfortunate.

09:12.690 --> 09:15.700
I pray for your safety and success.

09:16.530 --> 09:18.450
I will definitely pull through!

09:19.580 --> 09:23.140
Our passwords are Pireon and Numai.

09:23.140 --> 09:24.720
Two major gold coins?

09:24.720 --> 09:26.160
Doesn't it sound lucky?

09:40.230 --> 09:42.140
Have you remembered the path?

09:42.140 --> 09:43.340
Once I go underground,

09:43.340 --> 09:46.480
I should move forward with my hand 
touching the right wall, correct?

09:46.480 --> 09:47.140
Yes.

09:47.450 --> 09:49.730
Please wait for us at the end of that path.

09:49.730 --> 09:52.940
The building above that point is 
where Holo is being held, right?

09:52.940 --> 09:55.170
Yes. Our information has been confirmed.

09:55.170 --> 09:58.450
We will begin the operation to take 
her back at the opening bell of the market.

09:58.820 --> 10:03.660
If we succeed, the cover above you 
will open and your companion will join you.

10:03.660 --> 10:07.900
At that point, if you hear the word "Rahhe", 
wait for my colleague to join you.

10:07.900 --> 10:12.000
If you hear "Perouso," please escape 
immediately on the planned path.

10:12.000 --> 10:14.100
So it'll be "boom" or "bust"?

10:14.100 --> 10:15.540
Isn't it easy to understand?

10:19.750 --> 10:21.330
It's almost time.

10:34.310 --> 10:35.780
That was dangerous!

10:36.370 --> 10:37.570
Be more careful!

10:37.570 --> 10:38.750
I'm so sorry!

10:40.590 --> 10:41.540
Mr. Lawrence.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.430
Now's the time.

10:52.890 --> 10:53.870
Hurry!

11:04.220 --> 11:06.680
I can't believe they prepared all of this...

11:08.540 --> 11:12.920
I've heard that the Church 
uses the guise of digging graves

11:12.920 --> 11:15.750
to dig underground passages 
for espionage and tax evasion...

11:25.220 --> 11:26.810
This should be the place...

12:04.070 --> 12:07.430
Please, don't get rough...

12:13.620 --> 12:15.730
What am I trembling for?!

12:40.910 --> 12:42.070
They're taking too long...

12:42.630 --> 12:44.980
Did I get the place wrong?

12:45.410 --> 12:46.430
Rahhe.

12:48.310 --> 12:49.280
Rahhe.

12:49.280 --> 12:50.220
Numai!

12:51.140 --> 12:52.200
Pireon.

13:01.710 --> 13:02.670
Holo!

13:03.950 --> 13:07.090
You want us to take this 
and make it look like a burglary?

13:07.090 --> 13:08.020
Hurry up!

13:08.730 --> 13:11.050
I cannot descend unless you 
move out of the way.

13:11.050 --> 13:11.520
Huh?

13:12.150 --> 13:14.470
Y-Yeah.

13:19.420 --> 13:20.300
Ho—

13:20.980 --> 13:22.810
What are you standing there for?

13:23.910 --> 13:27.410
This is your share. Hurry up. Take it and go.

13:27.410 --> 13:29.030
Y-Yeah!

14:09.670 --> 14:10.450
Pireon.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.610
Pireon!

14:13.610 --> 14:14.460
Numai.

14:26.450 --> 14:28.340
Looks like things are going well...

14:33.580 --> 14:36.350
The business world is always full of surprises!

14:38.580 --> 14:40.100
There was one more person.

14:40.100 --> 14:42.440
He'll go out from a different exit.

14:42.830 --> 14:46.780
We'll leave town after I relay some 
information about Medio Trading to a comrade.

14:46.780 --> 14:48.140
Very thorough.

14:48.140 --> 14:49.860
I wish the both of you luck.

14:51.890 --> 14:52.860
Clear.

15:03.510 --> 15:05.150
I'm glad you're safe.

15:06.100 --> 15:08.660
You're glad I'm safe?

15:09.210 --> 15:10.220
Yeah.

15:11.250 --> 15:13.220
Say my name.

15:13.220 --> 15:14.760
Holo, right?

15:14.760 --> 15:16.310
Wise Wolf Holo!

15:16.780 --> 15:22.720
I can name every person 
who has embarrassed me in my entire life until now!

15:22.720 --> 15:25.440
And now I must remember yet another name!

15:25.900 --> 15:27.400
I am talking about you!

15:28.190 --> 15:30.400
I told you clearly, didn't I?!

15:30.690 --> 15:32.820
To come for me!

15:33.160 --> 15:34.890
Y-Yeah.

15:34.890 --> 15:36.330
I...

15:36.860 --> 15:40.410
I was sure you were the one 
who came for me and...

15:42.050 --> 15:44.830
Just thinking about it makes me so angry!

15:44.830 --> 15:47.130
Don't tell me, you...

15:47.130 --> 15:51.800
If you are a male, you should have 
sharpened your fangs and leapt into battle!

15:51.800 --> 15:54.840
Instead, you hid in that hole!

15:55.290 --> 15:59.110
I was needlessly humiliated because of that!

16:00.150 --> 16:02.310
But you're safe, aren't you?

16:06.870 --> 16:08.780
I'm glad you're safe.

16:14.740 --> 16:18.940
I cannot die as long as 
you hold onto that wheat.

16:19.740 --> 16:23.460
I am cute. Human males fall for me easily.

16:24.330 --> 16:28.880
Be that as it may, 
no human male could handle me.

16:28.880 --> 16:31.880
When I told them that their thing 
will get torn off if they touch me,

16:31.880 --> 16:34.420
everyone grew pale with fright.

16:34.830 --> 16:36.260
You...

16:38.550 --> 16:39.660
Goodness.

16:40.210 --> 16:41.890
There was one outlier.

16:43.060 --> 16:47.150
Who do you think was among 
those that captured me?

16:49.420 --> 16:51.060
Who was there?

16:52.630 --> 16:53.650
Yarei.

16:54.060 --> 16:55.160
You know him, do you not?

16:55.160 --> 16:56.410
Yarei?!

16:56.410 --> 16:57.660
From Pasloe village.

16:58.150 --> 17:00.910
It seems like he heard my name from Zheren.

17:01.300 --> 17:03.670
Did you speak to him?

17:04.420 --> 17:05.910
Just a bit.

17:08.340 --> 17:10.670
What do you think Yarei said to me?

17:20.970 --> 17:24.730
The guy named Zheren said your name was Holo.

17:26.180 --> 17:29.150
That's when I thought of the possibility that

17:30.170 --> 17:32.610
you were the god of harvest from my village.

17:34.300 --> 17:36.070
You're really her.

17:43.530 --> 17:46.660
I... You know, I...

17:48.070 --> 17:50.490
It is pathetic, but that made me so happy.

17:51.870 --> 17:55.220
But he told me this immediately after:

17:57.240 --> 18:00.970
The era of trying to get 
on your good side is over.

18:00.970 --> 18:04.310
There's no longer any need 
to be afraid of your temper.

18:04.860 --> 18:09.270
We'll turn you into the Church 
and say goodbye to the old era.

18:14.230 --> 18:18.230
I felt so chagrined and sorrowful...

18:28.750 --> 18:31.390
Well, think of it in a different way.

18:35.300 --> 18:38.970
Either way, you had to leave the village 
in order to return north.

18:39.330 --> 18:41.250
If they're not sorry to see you go,

18:41.250 --> 18:43.390
then kick sand in their faces as you leave.

18:43.730 --> 18:45.780
You'll be able to cut ties 
more cleanly that way.

18:46.300 --> 18:48.640
But when you leave, you make them pay a price.

18:48.640 --> 18:52.220
We're merchants. Everything is fine 
as long as we make money.

18:55.150 --> 18:59.480
We don't laugh until the money comes in, 
and we don't cry until we've gone bankrupt.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.510
And you and I,

19:02.270 --> 19:03.910
we'll definitely laugh.

19:12.470 --> 19:14.290
Yes, I feel much better.

19:15.830 --> 19:19.300
I have not spoken properly 
with anyone for hundreds of years.

19:20.580 --> 19:23.140
I have grown weak to emotion.

19:23.140 --> 19:25.570
Although I have cried twice in front of you,

19:25.570 --> 19:27.810
I am sure I would have cried 
whether you were here or not.

19:28.120 --> 19:30.540
Do you understand what I am trying to say?

19:30.540 --> 19:32.180
Don't misunderstand?

19:32.180 --> 19:32.940
Correct.

19:33.290 --> 19:36.200
I'm just doing everything for the money!

19:36.200 --> 19:40.200
Our job is to keep running until the Milone 
Trading Company seals the deal.

19:40.200 --> 19:43.200
You'd become a burden 
if you were sobbing the entire time.

19:43.620 --> 19:47.660
That's why even if it 
wasn't you, I would have...

19:51.070 --> 19:52.970
That's not very fair.

19:53.540 --> 19:55.310
A female's privilege, is it not?

19:59.330 --> 20:00.920
We've arrived.

20:00.920 --> 20:03.820
Have things been resolved 
between the two of you?

20:03.820 --> 20:04.930
Not yet.

20:05.890 --> 20:09.930
Count Erhendott is the one 
behind Medio Trading.

20:10.210 --> 20:12.730
The merchants dealing with wheat 
in the Count's territory are the ones

20:12.730 --> 20:14.650
who've been targeted 
to collect the silver coins.

20:14.650 --> 20:16.650
Please let Mr. Marlheit know.

20:16.650 --> 20:18.060
No problem.

20:18.550 --> 20:21.820
As expected, the ones who 
bring up moneymaking ideas

20:21.820 --> 20:23.150
are a little different from others.

20:23.150 --> 20:25.380
Are you talking about my ears?

20:26.680 --> 20:31.750
I was thinking about becoming a merchant 
again after watching the two of you.

20:32.990 --> 20:34.420
That's not a good idea.

20:35.250 --> 20:37.670
You'll end up picking up people like her.

20:38.180 --> 20:41.970
Well, a driver's box is too big for one person.

20:42.760 --> 20:44.840
I couldn't ask for more.

20:55.450 --> 20:58.530
I am also in a terrible mess 
after being picked up by you.

21:00.060 --> 21:01.780
As I thought, you're not being fair.

21:01.780 --> 21:04.070
But I am still cute, am I not?

21:05.660 --> 21:08.570
Well, it's true that you're cute.

21:12.590 --> 21:13.750
I'm glad.

21:16.100 --> 21:19.130
You are really a cute boy yourself.

23:45.060 --> 23:50.070
Episode 6

23:45.060 --> 23:50.070
Merchant and Unreasonable God

23:45.900 --> 23:49.270
Next Episode: Merchant and Unreasonable God
